WEEK 3 — BACKEND SETUP AND GST PRICING ENGINE

Date: Monday, 24 August 2026

Problem: Bill totals were off by a paisa because decimal rupee maths adds tiny errors, and odd paise could not be split into CGST and SGST.

Solution:
- Changed every money calculation to whole paise, converting only for display.
- Set CGST = tax divided by 2 (rounded) and SGST = tax minus CGST.
- Wrote the first node:test suite to check that every bill adds up exactly.
- Changed the test command to node --test "test/**/*.test.js" so the tests are found.
- Built the bag APIs (open, add, change quantity, remove) on top of the pricing function.
